     5010             .
     5011           end.
     5012         end.
     5013         put stream text_out unformatted
     5014           Header-Name                     skip
     5015           Header-Line0 + Header-add-Line0 skip
     5016           Header-Line1 + Header-add-Line1 skip
     5017           Header-Line2 + Header-add-Line2 skip
     5018           Header-Line3 + Header-add-Line3 skip
     5019           Header-Line4 + Header-add-Line4 skip
     5020         .
